<title>UK: Average discount rate at UK bill tender 5.8415 pct.</title>
<headline>Average discount rate at UK bill tender 5.8415 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average rate of discount at the weekly tender of 91-day UK Treasury bills fell to 5.8415 percent from 5.8746 percent last week, the Bank of England said on Friday.</p>
<p>The 400  million stg offer attracted bids of 2.547 billion stg. The pro rata price was 98-54.</p>
<p>Next week 400 million stg of bills will be on offer.</p>
